//! Standalone threat/trust-model registry checker (fgdb-g0-threat-model-nqd).
//!
//! stdout is stable NDJSON; stderr is human diagnostics. Exit status is 0 for a
//! clean registry, 1 for validation violations, and 2 for usage/load failures.
//!
//! `--write` regenerates `docs/THREAT_AND_TRUST_MODEL.md` from the registry.
//! Without it the committed document is compared against the regenerated bytes
//! and a difference is a violation: a generated artifact nobody regenerates is
//! a hand-edited artifact wearing a banner.

